  "air_date": "2026-11-08",
  "spoken": "One band proved your blood goes round. William Harvey tied it tight round a man's arm. The hand went cold. No blood was getting in. He loosened it, just a little. The veins below the band swelled up like ropes. So blood goes in through the arteries, and comes home through the veins. Look at your hand. That blood is heading home now.",
